Z||000000||Robert||02-26-2001||09:57 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Samoas.jpg"> <P>I have in my possession a few (well maybe 15) boxes of first edition 2001 Girl Scout Samoas.  I need some help reducing the number of boxes (and my waist line), so I thought it would be fun to have a contest.  The winner gets an unopened box of Samoas shipped by UPS to your location (lower 48 only, sorry Cliff) free.<BR>All you have to do is reply with a short poem.  The words “Fiero” & “Samoas” must be in the poem, and it should rhyme.   <BR>May the best poem win……  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>||||reg||10
Z||000001||2xsess||02-26-2001||10:49 PM||||LMAO, what a way to avoid eating all those cookies by yourself.<BR>I'm not a poet so I won't even try. Just had to comment on your idea.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2xsess.gif">      <BR> <A HREF="http://kresgeus.homestead.com/FieroPage.html" TARGET=_blank>Visit My Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Phaeton||02-27-2001||01:14 AM||||In my Fiero on the passenger seat<BR>Is a box of Samoas, ready to eat.<BR>A gift from my girl scout, barely twelve,<BR>At what cost to my diet I should not delve.<P>Samoas and keboards are the root of all heft<BR>And my Fiero is leaning decidedly left.<BR>So keep all your Samoas far far away,<BR>'Cause I still fit in my Fiero today.||||reg||12
